Emerald 3DS changes to pret/pokeemerald 76463dac15cad36aca5e2b3f6366abf9e53f814f: Korean battle yes/no box
Applies after 0060-korean-naming-screen.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

Korean build only (GAME_LANGUAGE == LANGUAGE_KOREAN): the battle yes/no box is
two tiles wider, to the left, so that 아니오 fits; its cursor moves with it.

diff --git a/include/battle_script_commands.h b/include/battle_script_commands.h
index fe6e98d..3dd8fc3 100644
--- a/include/battle_script_commands.h
+++ b/include/battle_script_commands.h
@@ -8,7 +8,14 @@
 #define WINDOW_BG1   (1 << 7)
 
 // Arguments for 'xStart, yStart, xEnd, yEnd' in HandleBattleWindow
+// The yes/no box: two tiles wider in Korean, for "아니오".
+#if GAME_LANGUAGE == LANGUAGE_KOREAN
+#define YESNOBOX_X_Y 22, 8, 29, 13
+#define YESNOBOX_CURSOR_X 0x17
+#else
 #define YESNOBOX_X_Y 24, 8, 29, 13
+#define YESNOBOX_CURSOR_X 0x19
+#endif
 
 void AI_CalcDmg(u8 attacker, u8 defender);
 u8 TypeCalc(u16 move, u8 attacker, u8 defender);
diff --git a/src/battle_bg.c b/src/battle_bg.c
